{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111074","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111074/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111074/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111074/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111074","id":3469553399,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rV6Tp","number":111074,"title":"Allow extracting translation strings without generating POT","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2025-09-30T13:42:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T10:51:37Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T08:07:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111074","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111074","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111074.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111074.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The POT generation feature has the advantage of automatically extracting translatable strings from various sources (scenes, scripts, and other resources via custom `EditorTranslationParserPlugin`s).\r\n\r\nHowever, not all users like `gettext` workflow; some prefer the out-of-the-box supported CSV translation feature or even implement their own formats (the `Translation` class has a corresponding API for customization). The inability to access standard parsers makes this inconvenient and forces the use of POT generation.\r\n\r\nThis PR exposes access to standard parsers. Since the `EditorTranslationParser` singleton isn't exposed, access to its methods is provided through static `EditorTranslationParserPlugin` methods. An alternative would be to do this through `EditorPlugin` (as with the `add_parser()` and `remove_parser()` methods), but I think it would be a bad idea to clutter the rather generic `EditorPlugin` with unrelated methods. Also, `EditorTranslationParserPlugin` seems like a pretty expected place for these methods.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this PR provides access to the list of built-in strings, which corresponds to the \"Add Built-in Strings to POT\" checkbox in the editor interface.\r\n\r\nThis PR slightly breaks compatibility: now custom plugins added later have priority, not earlier ones. On the other hand, this could be considered a bug fix.","closed_by":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111074/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111074/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}